<section class="wrap narrow reveal">
  <div class="frame frame--creed">
    <p class="lede">A framework is worth exactly what it is prepared to lose. Four of these claims are
      borrowed, six are asserted, four are owed, and three can be taken away from us by a measurement.
      That is the honest shape of it.</p>
